# #5833, C4. A write with no routing stamp is appended as PreArm rather than truly
# unstamped: it raises no shared watermark and no generation fences it, so the receiver
# passes it.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestUnroutedWriteAsPreArm
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a write with no routing stamp is appended as PreArm
PERTURBS: UnroutedAlloc
BOUNDS: WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = StaleDonor]
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
    /\ lastU' = next

--- REPLACE
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = StaleDonor]
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
\* MUTATION: the shared watermark is not raised.
    /\ UNCHANGED lastU

--- END
